starhermit-runtime's starhermit:sky (crates/starhermit-runtime/src/script/prelude/sky.ts
and sky_wgsl.ts) ports the atmosphere (Hillaire 2020's lookup tables), the time of
day, and the sun, moon, stars and Milky Way from Solstice (crates/solstice-render:
sky.rs, time_of_day.rs, shaders/common/atmosphere.wgsl, shaders/common/environment.wgsl,
shaders/sky/luts.wgsl, shaders/sky/bodies.wgsl, shaders/sky/milky_way*.wgsl),
distributed under the following license.

starhermit-sys (crates/starhermit-sys, with its shaders in
crates/starhermit-web/web/graphics.mjs) ports the temporal anti-aliasing
with upscaling (Halton jitter, 3x3 closest-depth reprojection, YCoCg
neighbourhood clipping, the reactive mask and the Catmull-Rom history
lookup) from Solstice's renderer (crates/solstice-render/src/post.rs,
crates/solstice-render/shaders/post/taa.wgsl), distributed under the
following license.

starhermit-sys (crates/starhermit-sys, with its shaders in
crates/starhermit-web/web/graphics.mjs) also ports, as fragment passes, the
screen-space effects: automatic exposure (crates/solstice-render/src/post.rs,
shaders/post/exposure.wgsl), the depth pyramid and hierarchical screen traces
(src/gi/depth_pyramid.rs, src/gi/screen.rs, shaders/gi/depth_pyramid.wgsl,
shaders/gi/screen_trace.wgsl, shaders/gi/screen_history.wgsl), the
screen-space reflections and probes (shaders/gi/reflections.wgsl,
shaders/gi/probe_trace.wgsl, probe_project.wgsl, probe_integrate.wgsl) and
specular anti-aliasing (shaders/lighting/specular_aa.wgsl), distributed under
the following license.

starhermit-bc (crates/starhermit-bc) ports the BC4/BC5 endpoint search, the
block unpacking and the coverage-preserving alpha mips (Castano 2010, per
tile, with colour filled under holes) from Solstice
(crates/solstice-builder/src/texture.rs, crates/solstice-render/src/scene.rs,
docs/cutouts.md), distributed under the following license.

starhermit-meshlod (crates/starhermit-meshlod) ports the quadric-error
half-edge collapse simplifier (attribute corners, the texture-slide and skin
error terms, locked borders) and the foliage thinning from Solstice
(crates/solstice-builder/src/simplify.rs and thin.rs), distributed under the
following license.

starhermit-weather (crates/starhermit-weather) and the starhermit:weather
module it gives the runtime port techniques and shader constants of the
wind field and foliage sway from Solstice by SamG-Coder
(crates/solstice-render/src/wind.rs, shaders/wind/field.wgsl,
shaders/common/wind.wgsl, shaders/common/sway.wgsl and
shaders/common/sway_vertex.wgsl), and the weather model and its built-in
.weather files, the cloud noise, model and march, rain, wet surfaces and
lightning (crates/solstice-render/src/clouds, src/rain, src/lightning.rs,
weather/*.weather, shaders/clouds/*.wgsl, shaders/rain/*.wgsl,
shaders/lightning/bolt.wgsl, shaders/common/wetness.wgsl, docs/wetness.md
and docs/weather-effects.md; starhermit-runtime's prelude/weather_fx.ts and
weather_fx_wgsl.ts), distributed under the following license.

starhermit-vehicle (crates/starhermit-vehicle) ports the vehicle model of Solstice's
solstice-vehicle crate (tyres, suspension, drivetrain, aerodynamics, driver aids, driver
input shaping, the `.vehicle` format and surfaces, with its tests) and the circuit, lap
timing and autopilot of its solstice-game crate (src/track.rs, src/race.rs, src/drive.rs),
distributed under the following license.

starhermit-physics-3d (crates/starhermit-physics-3d) follows Solstice's
collision builder in thinning a mesh's points for a convex hull (the
furthest along directions on a Fibonacci spiral, then the rest evenly;
crates/solstice-builder/src/collision.rs), and its character controller's
tests re-express Solstice's walking tests
(crates/solstice-physics/tests/walking.rs), distributed under the following
license.

starhermit-particles (crates/starhermit-particles: src/effect.rs and
src/emitter/motion.rs) and starhermit:particles' GPU emitters
(crates/starhermit-runtime/src/script/prelude/particles.ts) port Solstice's
particle system: the `.particles` effect format and its reader, the
gradient and curl noise, the forces carried through drag (wind, curl,
buoyancy, attract, vortex) and the depth collision and soft fade
(crates/solstice-render/src/particles/effect.rs,
crates/solstice-render/shaders/particles/*.wgsl,
crates/solstice-render/shaders/common/noise.wgsl, docs/particles.md),
re-expressed as fragment passes, distributed under the following license.

starhermit-runtime's animation graphs,
compressed clips and role-file retargeting (prelude/scene_animation_40.ts)
follow Solstice's crates/solstice-anim (graph.rs, clip.rs, pose.rs) and
crates/solstice-import (animation.rs, character.rs), distributed under the

starhermit-water (crates/starhermit-water) ports the Elfouhaily wind sea
with Donelan and Banner's spreading and the JONSWAP swell, their parameters
and the unresolved-slope table (crates/solstice-render/src/ocean/spectrum.rs),
and the engine's starhermit:water module (crates/starhermit-runtime/src/script/
prelude/water.ts) follows Solstice's ocean (docs/ocean.md; the CDLOD grid,
shoaling over a seabed map, the water shading, ponds and the waterline map of
crates/solstice-render/src/ocean/ and shaders/ocean/), distributed under the
following license.

starhermit-runtime's animation graphs, compressed clips and role-file
retargeting (prelude/scene_animation_40.ts) follow Solstice's
crates/solstice-anim (graph.rs, clip.rs, pose.rs) and crates/solstice-import
(animation.rs, character.rs); its cached shadow cascades (src/shadow_cache.rs:
coarse snapping with a padded radius, held light directions, far cascades
taking turns, static casters cached under moving ones) and starhermit:scene's
contact shadows follow Solstice's renderer (crates/solstice-render/src/shadow.rs,
shaders/lighting/deferred.wgsl). Both are distributed under the following
license.

starhermit-procgen (crates/starhermit-procgen, run as wasm32 or natively
through crates/starhermit-procgen-kernel) ports Solstice's procgen
(crates/solstice-procgen: the noise, seamless fields, crack growth, surface
baker and surface library, barks, and the grass and weeds of the .grass
form), and the engine's starhermit:surfaces module
(crates/starhermit-runtime/src/script/prelude/surfaces.ts) follows the
terrain blend and hide-tiling of Solstice's resolve shader
(crates/solstice-render/shaders/vg/resolve.wgsl), distributed under the
following license.

